e name and click ‘submit’.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.944; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.944; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:588px;height:401px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9192296873/original/s2Hoc65kotcwkkNJ0Po4xKEnQqudLzxhKA.png?1690989385\" width=\"588\" height=\"401\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9192296873\"></span></span><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.944; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">You will then be brought to the 3 step process where you can verify the full HMRC p46 return form data before entering in your HMRC credentials on the 2nd page and finally submitting on the 3rd.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.944; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.944; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:675px;height:350px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9192296929/original/uPNBQoUcp3n8B4YUOa0TH7Pm3TSIn9pWsQ.png?1690989418\" width=\"675\" height=\"350\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9192296929\"></span></span><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"fo